<Layout title="About"><section class="about-page reading"><span class="eyebrow">A small record</span><h1>Between waking<br />and dreaming.</h1><div class="prose"><p>I write about life, culture, and whatever stays on my mind.</p><p>Sometimes a dream leaves behind a vivid image. If I can still remember it when I wake, I describe it to AI and see what takes shape.</p><p>This is a place to keep both: words I write myself, and images that begin in dreams.</p><p>The writing appears in Chinese and English. The dreams have no single style.</p></div><blockquote>“I made a small record of the existence of carbon-based life.”<cite>From Here On</cite></blockquote><a class="text-link" href="/writing/from-here-on-en/">Read the first essay</a></section></Layout>
